      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, well, Ser Arisen! I see that you've agreed\r\nto handle the monster extermination request\r\nfor the Volden Large Tunnels!",
        "Jp" : "これはこれは、覚者さん！\r\n《ボルド大坑道》の魔物退治の件\r\n引き受けてくださるんですな！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 446173,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What a relief this is!\r\nThe redevelopment of the Volden Large Tunnels\r\nis a vital task that we cannot avoid.",
        "Jp" : "いやぁ、助かります！\r\n《ボルド大坑道》の再開発はこのエリアにとって\r\n避けては通れない重大な課題でしてね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482179,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As of late, rumors claim of a skeletal knight\r\nwandering the mines... They're saying,\r\n\"a glowing skull stares from the depths.\"\r\nIt's probably just skeletons or something.",
        "Jp" : "なんでも、骸骨騎士が坑内を歩いている――とか\r\n光るドクロが坑道の奥からこっちを見てた――とか\r\nおおかたスケルトンか何かだと思うんですけどねぇ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482181,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "We need to address these strange rumors\r\ndiscouraging miners from coming in to work,\r\nas soon as possible.",
        "Jp" : "鉱員が集まらなくなる妙な噂は\r\n早めにどうにかしてしまわないといけません"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482180,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Once word spreads that the problem has been\r\ntaken care of, the miners should return.\r\nWe're counting on you for this one!",
        "Jp" : "覚者さんがちゃんと退治してくださったと\r\n言えるようになれば、また鉱員も集まるでしょう\r\nここは一つ、よろしくお願いしますよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482182,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
