      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Speaking of which, any news on those strange\r\nrumors regarding the Volden Large Tunnels?",
        "Jp" : "そういえば、《ボルド大坑道》の妙な噂については\r\nどうなりましたかな？"
